WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.531 --> 00:00:12.179
"You're getting a babysitter tonight," Dad said.

2
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.732
"I don't need one.

3
00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:16.941
I'm not a baby," I complained.

4
00:00:16.942 --> 00:00:20.366
"Sorry, Bobby," Mom said.

5
00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:24.182
"We can't leave you home alone at night."

6
00:00:24.183 --> 00:00:27.830
"Fine," I grumbled.

7
00:00:27.831 --> 00:00:30.563
"When will Carla get here?"

8
00:00:30.564 --> 00:00:34.654
"Carla has a softball game tonight," Dad said.

9
00:00:34.655 --> 00:00:38.433
"Mrs. Muller will babysit you instead."

10
00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:49.727
"Oh no!" I thought. "She's scary!"

11
00:00:49.728 --> 00:00:53.498
Mrs. Muller arrived.

12
00:00:53.499 --> 00:00:57.486
"The first aid kit is in the closet," Mom said.

13
00:00:57.487 --> 00:01:00.778
"There's a list of emergency phone numbers on the counter.

14
00:01:00.779 --> 00:01:02.698
Bobby doesn't have any food allergies.

15
00:01:02.699 --> 00:01:05.799
And his bedtime is at ten."

16
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:09.405
Mom and Dad left.

17
00:01:09.406 --> 00:01:14.050
"Did you finish your homework?" Mrs. Muller asked.

18
00:01:14.051 --> 00:01:17.785
"No. Tomorrow is Saturday," I said.

19
00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:31.949
"No excuses," she said sternly. "Go get started."

20
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:36.201
A little while later I went into the kitchen.

21
00:01:36.202 --> 00:01:38.900
"What's for dinner?" I asked.

22
00:01:38.901 --> 00:01:43.274
"Turkey burgers!" she said.

23
00:01:43.275 --> 00:01:50.917
"And I don't want to hear any complaints!"

24
00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:54.345
After dinner I asked to watch TV.

25
00:01:54.346 --> 00:01:57.777
"Sure," Mrs. Muller said.

26
00:01:57.778 --> 00:02:03.127
"We'll watch my favorite show."

27
00:02:03.128 --> 00:02:09.396
"It's probably something boring," I thought.

28
00:02:09.397 --> 00:02:13.970
She flicked through the TV channels.

29
00:02:13.971 --> 00:02:17.259
Then she stopped at channel ten.

30
00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.025
Space Rangers was on.

31
00:02:20.026 --> 00:02:22.502
I looked at her in surprise.

32
00:02:22.503 --> 00:02:25.305
"This is your favorite show too?"

33
00:02:25.306 --> 00:02:31.649
"Of course!" she said.

34
00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:36.682
After the show Mrs. Muller pointed to my video games.

35
00:02:36.683 --> 00:02:41.155
"Do you have Super Ninja?" she asked.

36
00:02:41.156 --> 00:02:45.719
"Wow! You play video games?" I asked.

37
00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:50.606
"I play them with my grandson," she said.

38
00:02:50.607 --> 00:03:03.480
"And watch out. I usually win!"

39
00:03:03.481 --> 00:03:07.917
Soon it was ten o'clock.

40
00:03:07.918 --> 00:03:13.589
"Time flies," she said. "It's your bedtime."

41
00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:16.789
I sighed.

42
00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:20.907
"Hmm," Mrs. Muller said.

43
00:03:20.908 --> 00:03:26.937
"I guess one more game wouldn't hurt."

44
00:03:26.938 --> 00:03:31.187
"Can you be my babysitter next time?" I asked.

45
00:03:31.188 --> 00:03:34.480
Mrs. Muller nodded, "Sure."

46
00:03:34.481 --> 00:03:37.608
She even smiled at me.

47
00:03:37.609 --> 00:03:43.917
Mrs. Muller wasn't scary after all.
